Source: torrentngd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: TorrentNG Maintainers <keith@snape.tech>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/snapetech/TorrentNG
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: torrentngd
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, systemd
Description: native TorrentNG BitTorrent client and WebUI/API
 TorrentNG is a native BitTorrent client with a shared WebUI and API. This
 package installs the release binaries for amd64 and arm64, starts the daemon
 under a dedicated system account, and binds its API to loopback by default.
